{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world above the sky in Hopwander, a short indie game about unlikely heroes. As a small frog, you must navigate floating islands, solve puzzles, interact with odd characters, and defend yourself from\u00a0against the creatures that roam the skies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take command of your little frog and lead them through a charming, skybound world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/5b28cf62c15b38d37417292a004def89.poster.avif?t=1772317336\" width=600 height=116 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/5b28cf62c15b38d37417292a004def89.webm?t=1772317336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/5b28cf62c15b38d37417292a004def89.mp4?t=1772317336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of puzzles strewn around the sky lands will test your intellect. Discover mysteries, open magical doors, and solve clever puzzles. You get closer to solving the world's mysteries with each puzzle you complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/5d9aa6f7ec5e1df6594e6eb66c72ebc8.poster.avif?t=1772317336\" width=600 height=126 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/5d9aa6f7ec5e1df6594e6eb66c72ebc8.webm?t=1772317336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/5d9aa6f7ec5e1df6594e6eb66c72ebc8.mp4?t=1772317336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to a variety of entertaining personalities that live there. Every interaction, from oddball animals to sage mentors, adds a bit of warmth and fun to your travels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/3e9951dd781059d8053c21c5a2ccabc4.poster.avif?t=1772317336\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/3e9951dd781059d8053c21c5a2ccabc4.webm?t=1772317336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/3e9951dd781059d8053c21c5a2ccabc4.mp4?t=1772317336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Of course, not everything above the clouds is peaceful. You\u2019ll face monsters that block your path.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/9e6fd545488beba415c7165af2acb26e.poster.avif?t=1772317336\" width=600 height=138 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/9e6fd545488beba415c7165af2acb26e.webm?t=1772317336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2749620/extras/9e6fd545488beba415c7165af2acb26e.mp4?t=1772317336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hopwander is a small adventure about exploring the unknown, helping others, and discovering what lies beyond the next island in the sky.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepag